			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400390101,
					"content": "北斗正在孤云阁那边帮我打捞散落的群玉阁藏品。你们若有兴趣，可以去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4003902,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4003902
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4003902",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4003902,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"凝光"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400390201,
					"content": "还真是少了很多东西啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390202,
					"content": "什么东西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400390203,
					"content": "与先前相比，如今这座群玉阁里少了许多东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390204,
					"content": "我收藏的许多书籍，家具和小饰品，都随着那座群玉阁坠入海中…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390205,
					"content": "这些物品大都在那场大难中毁坏了，少部分幸存的散落在海面上，极难回收。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390206,
					"content": "只有擅长水上工作的人才能替我办到这件事。只是…不知道北斗能不能把它们都捞回来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390207,
					"content": "捞回来？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400390208,
					"content": "欸？你让北斗去捞那些东西了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390209,
					"content": "「让」这个字，不够精准。我们之间向来是公平交易。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390210,
					"content": "北斗拿钱办事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400390211,
					"content": "除了「钱」之外，还有其他的「报酬」…呵呵，这些事复杂着呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390212,
					"content": "总之，北斗现在正在孤云阁一带。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390213,
					"content": "你们若有兴趣，可以去看看。说不定，你们也能帮到她的忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "凝光"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4003904,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4003904
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4003904",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4003904,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"北斗",
					"辛焱"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400390401,
					"content": "那个麻烦的女人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390402,
					"content": "那座群玉阁在海上撞了个粉碎，里面的东西肯定也都被撞坏了，怎么可能捞得上来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390403,
					"content": "打捞还顺利吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400390404,
					"content": "旅行者？你们怎么来了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390405,
					"content": "我是来帮忙的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400390406,
					"content": "哦！你来得正好，现在全船的人都出动了，人手实在是不够用。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390407,
					"content": "你看，我连辛焱都拉来帮忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390408,
					"content": "辛焱居然也来了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400390409,
					"content": "对喔，辛焱怎么会在船上？难道是有演出？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390410,
					"content": "是啊！虽然也算不上正式音乐演出啦，是北斗姐说想办宴会，请我来唱两首歌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390411,
					"content": "但什么都还没开始，忽然有个自称是凝光秘书的人过来，把北斗姐叫走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "辛焱"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390412,
					"content": "是叫百闻还是百晓来着？唔…有些记不清了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390413,
					"content": "反正就是凝光又突发奇想，要我帮她到海上打捞藏品，作为交换她会支付一大笔劳务费。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390414,
					"content": "哼…既然资金到位，这活儿我们接就接了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390415,
					"content": "打捞啊，必须得用小船。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390416,
					"content": "船队里能动用的小船都出发了，不过眼下还缺一艘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400390417,
					"content": "我有一艘小船。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400390418
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400390418,
					"content": "你有船？那正好，我们就坐你的船出海。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
