					"nextDialogs": [
						400391103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391103,
					"content": "都给我停下，东西也都放下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391104,
					"content": "北…北斗姐！您、您怎么来了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391105,
					"content": "溜溜，你在这里做什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391106,
					"content": "哎呀，兄弟们这不是…撞了大运，从海上捞到了点好东西吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391107,
					"content": "北斗姐喜欢什么，随便拿！就当是兄弟们孝敬您的，哈哈哈！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391108,
					"content": "是吗？那这些东西就全都留下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391109,
					"content": "这…这…您多少得讲点道上规矩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391110,
					"content": "兄弟们忙前忙后，好歹得喝一口汤吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391111,
					"content": "这东西不是你们能碰的。我再说一遍，把东西放下，然后有多远滚多远。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391112,
					"content": "这…不太好吧…北斗姐，不然我们再…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溜溜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391113,
					"content": "呼…看来你是在拖时间啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400391114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 400391114,
					"content": "那也别废话了，来吧，我们过两招！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "北斗"
				}
